    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365200/extras/873ed6310773a0cf8bd0a475b238ab4e.avif?t=1687694516\" /></span><br><br><strong>[Synopsis]</strong><br><br>One day, all of a sudden, <br>Sora finds out that the elevator is connected to her room on her usual way to work.<br>She tries to find  a way to escape this endless Loop. Your choices will be a matter<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365200/extras/2175504615021aa113b50994576cad75.avif?t=1687694516\" /></span><br><br><strong>[How to Play]</strong><br><br>At the moment of decision, two options are given. You have to make a decision in 10 seconds. <br>You can skip the video using the arrow keys.<br><br><br><br><strong>[Game features]</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365200/extras/433e506212ad006d18ed40323d67da4d.avif?t=1687694516\" /></span><br><br>You can see the progress of the game on the flow chart menu. select a turning point, and change your decision<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2365200/extras/313de322ed1bb27620870fa0a50f21f9.avif?t=1687694516\" /></span><br><br>You can check out the ending list. Find the ending and collect the pictures.<br><br><br><strong>Find Your Escape</strong><br>your choices will always have consequences<br>.<br>.<br>.<br>.<br>.<br>.",
